  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women, Peace and Security: Building Sustainable Peace - Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Colombia, strengthening the capacities and knowledge of women and women&#x2019;s organizations will be key. The programme will mobilize women to take an active role in resolving community and local injustices and become agents of change and equality advocates.</narrative>
  </description>
